WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.434
-Here at "Late Night"
every night,

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.100
I deliver a monologue made up of
jokes written by

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.634
a diverse team of writers.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:08.567
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.901
that due to my being
a straight white male

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.868
would be difficult,
if we're being honest,

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:14.300
It would be difficult for me to
deliver.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.334
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them.

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:19.000
So we'd like to share them with
you now in a segment called

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.634
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:24.467
♪♪

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:26.300
-Hey, everybody.
These are two of our writers

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.334
Amber and Jenny.
-I'm black.

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.267
-And I'm gay.
-And we're both women.

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:31.834
-And I'm not.
So here's how it works --

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:34.968
I'll read the setups to these
jokes and Amber and Jenny

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.234
will read the punchlines,
here we go.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:40.400
According to the New York Post,
dressing like a lesbian

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.300
is the newest fashion trend.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.367
-"That's great news,"
said the makers of Crocs.

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:50.234
-According to a recent survey
the fastest growing group

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.400
of gun owners is black women.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.667
-This news was first reported
in a threat from grandma.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:57.701
[ Laughter ]
-Now, Amber,

00:00:57.701 --> 00:01:00.400
was your grandma strict?
-My grandma was so strict

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.834
she had her name legally changed
to "Ma'am."

00:01:03.834 --> 00:01:06.167
[ Laughter ]
-One of the Cohen brothers

00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:08.100
is reportedly planning to direct
a film

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.767
about a lesbian road trip.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:12.834
-It's called, "Look How Easily I
Just Changed This Tire."

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.467
-Ooh.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.934
-Seth, you know what's fun
about lesbian road trips?

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:18.868
-What's that?
-They all start out

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:22.167
in different places but they all
end up in the same place --

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:25.167
a Natalie Merchant concert.
-Oh.

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:28.334
The Labrador Retriever was
recently voted the number one

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:31.300
dog breed in the U.S.
-And white people celebrated

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:34.901
by kissing one on the mouth.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:38.567
-Now, Amber, is kissing dogs the
grossest thing white people do?

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:40.834
-No, Seth, the grossest thing
white people do

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:42.000
is gerrymandering.
-Oh.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:50.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:52.934
-And out lesbian judge was
recently appointed to

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.601
the 2nd U.S. Circuit
Court of Appeals.

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:58.534
-A lesbian judge is like a
straight judge except when she

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:00.834
says, "Please approach the
bench" it's to point out

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:03.000
all the places where it needs to
be sanded."

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:09.334
-Still my favorite.
-Thank you.

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:12.367
-FIFA, the governing body of
soccer recently hired it's first

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:14.934
black woman referee.
-Instead of red cards

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:19.234
and yellow cards, she'll just
give players this look.

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.901 --> 00:02:25.334
-And now was that a yellow card
or a red card?

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.601
-A yellow card.
-Okay.

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:28.767
Can you show us all a red card?

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:33.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:37.133
-A dog was recently dropped off
at a shelter after its owner

00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:40.400
became convinced it was gay.
-Their first clue was when

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:44.667
the dog looked at them and said,
"You're wearing that?"

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:46.767
-And now, Jenny,
what's the first clue

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:49.467
that a dog is a lesbian?
-It has three cats.

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:53.634
-Ah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.634 --> 00:02:57.100
-Scientists have reported that
some black holes have,

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:00.667
what is referred to as hair.
-Whish is rude because

00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:10.167
I told you that in confidence.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.167 --> 00:03:12.467
-Did that joke, did that go the
way you thought it would go?

00:03:12.467 --> 00:03:14.934
-Yeah, but I feel ashamed that I
said it.

00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:18.501
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.501 --> 00:03:23.167
-A new article on insider.com
outlines the steps lesbians

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:25.434
need to take to prepare for
retirement.

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:28.300
-Step one, stock up on
batteries.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:32.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:40.267
-Oh! [ Laughs ]

00:03:40.267 --> 00:03:41.267
Oh, batteries.

00:03:41.267 --> 00:03:43.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.501 --> 00:03:46.934
According to a recent report
the 2020 census over counted

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:48.968
white people --
-In their defense,

00:03:48.968 --> 00:03:52.100
it's easy to lose track because
you all look the same.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.634
-Oh, come on.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.634 --> 00:03:57.133
No we don't.
-Seth, counter point.

00:03:57.133 --> 00:04:05.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:07.601
-Hey, Seth,
why don't you tell one?

00:04:07.601 --> 00:04:09.701
-No, I couldn't!
-Come on, just one!

00:04:09.701 --> 00:04:11.200
-I just don't feel like
it'll end well.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.400
-Oh, come on.
-Do it!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.367
-Okay, okay. I trust you guys.
I trust you guys.

00:04:15.367 --> 00:04:17.701
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson
will become the first

00:04:17.701 --> 00:04:19.734
black female to sit
on the Supreme Court.

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:22.434
I can't believe Biden managed to
find a black woman

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:24.300
with an opinion.
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:29.000
-Seth! How dare you?!
-You said it would be okay!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.634
-You should be ashamed of
yourself.

00:04:30.634 --> 00:04:32.801
-Yellow card?
-Yellow card.

00:04:32.801 --> 00:04:34.534
-Red card?
-Red card!

00:04:34.534 --> 00:04:35.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.934 --> 00:04:39.667
Black women and lesbians
are liars!

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:42.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.834
Check out "The Amber Ruffin
Show" run by these two.

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:47.801
A new episode's up on Peacock
this Friday.

